msgid "La Beauté Éditoriale"
msgstr "Editorial Beauty"

msgid "Trois Regards,<br/>Une Beauté"
msgstr "Three Looks,<br/>One Beauty"

msgid "Une Beauté"
msgstr "One Beauty"

msgid "Formules transparentes, textures sensorielles, élégance sans compromis. Célébrez votre essence naturelle."
msgstr "Transparent formulas, sensorial textures, uncompromising elegance. Celebrate your natural essence."

msgid "Découvrir la Collection"
msgstr "Discover the Collection"

msgid "Sérum<br/>Glow"
msgstr "Glow<br/>Serum"

msgid "Fond de Teint<br/>Lumineux"
msgstr "Luminous<br/>Foundation"

msgid "Texture"
msgstr "Texture"

msgid "Portrait Éditorial<br/>Olesea, Amalia, Irina"
msgstr "Editorial Portrait<br/>Olesea, Amalia, Irina"

msgid "Clean<br/>Beauty"
msgstr "Clean<br/>Beauty"

msgid "La beauté révélée,<br/><span class=\"oa-editorial-accent\">jamais déguisée.</span>"
msgstr "Beauty revealed,<br/><span class=\"oa-editorial-accent\">never disguised.</span>"

msgid "La beauté révélée,<br/>"
msgstr "Beauty revealed,<br/>"

msgid "jamais déguisée."
msgstr "never disguised."

msgid "L'histoire de O&amp;A Beauty est née d'une fusion entre créativité, science et narration. <strong>Olesea</strong> sculpte la sensorialité de chaque produit, <strong>Amalia</strong> exige l'excellence des formules actives, et <strong>Irina</strong> tisse l'esthétique visuelle qui donne vie à la marque."
msgstr "The story of O&amp;A Beauty was born from a fusion of creativity, science, and storytelling. <strong>Olesea</strong> sculpts the sensoriality of each product, <strong>Amalia</strong> demands excellence in active formulas, and <strong>Irina</strong> weaves the visual aesthetics that bring the brand to life."

msgid "Nous créons des produits qui célèbrent vos imperfections autant que vos atouts, avec une formulation transparente et une touche de luxe."
msgstr "We create products that celebrate your imperfections as much as your strengths, with transparent formulation and a touch of luxury."

msgid "Notre Manifeste"
msgstr "Our Manifesto"

msgid "Le Soin."
msgstr "Skincare."

msgid "Nourrir en profondeur. Préparer la toile."
msgstr "Nourish deeply. Prepare the canvas."

msgid "Explorer"
msgstr "Explore"

msgid "La Couleur."
msgstr "Color."

msgid "Sublimer avec audace. Exalter la confiance."
msgstr "Enhance with boldness. Elevate confidence."

msgid "Science &amp; Nature"
msgstr "Science &amp; Nature"

msgid "Ingrédients Actifs de <span class=\"oa-editorial-accent\">Haute Performance</span>"
msgstr "High-Performance <span class=\"oa-editorial-accent\">Active Ingredients</span>"

msgid "Haute Performance"
msgstr "High-Performance"

msgid "Hydratation Bio-compatible"
msgstr "Bio-compatible Hydration"

msgid "Imite les huiles naturelles de la peau pour retenir l'hydratation sans obstruer les pores."
msgstr "Mimics the skin's natural oils to lock in moisture without clogging pores."

msgid "Repulpe &amp; Lisse"
msgstr "Plump &amp; Smooth"

msgid "Attire l'eau à la surface de la peau pour un aspect radieux, rebondi et rajeuni."
msgstr "Draws water to the skin's surface for a radiant, plump, and rejuvenated appearance."

msgid "Éclat Antioxydant"
msgstr "Antioxidant Radiance"

msgid "Illumine le teint, estompe les taches sombres et défend la peau contre les agresseurs environnementaux."
msgstr "Brightens the complexion, fades dark spots, and defends the skin against environmental aggressors."

msgid "La Communauté O&amp;A Beauty"
msgstr "The O&amp;A Beauty Community"

msgid "Rejoignez plus de <span class=\"oa-editorial-accent oa-counter-10k\" style=\"color: var(--oa-lilac);\">10000</span> clientes satisfaites"
msgstr "Join over <span class=\"oa-editorial-accent oa-counter-10k\" style=\"color: var(--oa-lilac);\">10000</span> satisfied customers"

msgid " clientes satisfaites"
msgstr " satisfied customers"

msgid "\"Les textures sont incroyables. Mon teint n'a jamais été aussi lumineux. Le Sérum Glow est devenu mon indispensable quotidien.\""
msgstr "\"The textures are incredible. My complexion has never been this luminous. The Glow Serum has become my daily essential.\""

msgid "— Sophie M."
msgstr "— Sophie M."

msgid "Acheteuse vérifiée"
msgstr "Verified Buyer"

msgid "\"Enfin du maquillage qui prend soin de ma peau sensible. La couvrance est parfaite et le rendu tellement naturel !\""
msgstr "\"Finally, makeup that cares for my sensitive skin. The coverage is perfect and the result is so natural!\""

msgid "— Claire T."
msgstr "— Claire T."

msgid "\"Une vraie expérience de luxe, de l'emballage jusqu'aux résultats visibles sur ma peau. Je suis conquise.\""
msgstr "\"A true luxury experience, from the packaging to the visible results on my skin. I am won over.\""

msgid "— Amandine D."
msgstr "— Amandine D."

msgid "Get the "
msgstr "Get the "

msgid "Look"
msgstr "Look"

msgid "L'essentiel pour un fini naturel et lumineux."
msgstr "The essentials for a natural and luminous finish."

